flowchart TD
  accTitle: Vendor-neutral logical platform context
  accDescr: Sources pass through integration, governed data products, and consumption while control planes provide quality, metadata, security, and operations.
  A[Source systems] --> B[Ingestion and integration]
  B --> C[Landing and accepted data]
  C --> D[Transformation and orchestration]
  D --> E[Governed data products]
  E --> F[Analytics and approved AI use]
  Q[Quality controls] -. governs .-> C
  M[Metadata and lineage] -. describes .-> D
  S[Security privacy and policy] -. protects .-> E
  O[Operations and cost] -. observes .-> B
  O -. observes .-> E
